Z||000027||FieroKyle||12-31-2001||02:54 PM||||After completing my first year of driving, the accident total soars to 4. Two deer in my Buick, on seperate occasions, then 2 in the Fiero. Some kid broadsided me because he didn't see me and hit me in the driver's side door. Car fixed, then my first one was when the left the car out of gear and it rolled in to a tree over night on flat pavement. Rolled aproxmitely 10 foot and took out a parking light. If I get hit in the rear and passenger side, I should have my car with all new exterior and paint by the end of next August, lol. I am good driver, people tell me I am a good one, I just have terrible luck.<P>But then last night I was driving my Buick with a bunch of friends and a deer ran out in front of me, just missed it. They were like, "you car is a deer magnet". I have to invest in some deer whistles.||||reg||1
