Z||000030||DaRkLoRD||12-31-2001||05:35 PM||||hmm, I've been driving for over 3 years now.. not a single accident.. a few near-misses... but nothing serious. worst one, was when I accidentally backed into a ditch. but I was able to drive out.. (one which could have been much worse, is when a dump truck tried to run me off the road.. he was doing 70 on the highway, so I pulled out to pass him.. no one else in sight.. he swerves into my lane and completely forces me off the road. 2 wheels were on gravel, the other 2 were a bit lower, on grass.... I held it steady, got back on the road, and floored it... I never found out why he did that, and I didn't really want to stick around to find out.)<BR>anyway, had I got my license when I was 16, it might be a different story.. but I didn't think I was responsible enough, so I waited until I was 18.. yes it was my decision, not my parents.<P>------------------<BR>    <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>    <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||4
